{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Submansion, you will travel through ten rooms in search of lost keys and an invaluable thing. Your guide will be the Keykeeper. At first glance, a helpless lady who could not even cope with her main task - to keep the keys. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391660/extras/ed216c79bd8874f58d3b3213e484f018.avif?t=1760811703\" width=1080 height=800 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete the challenges in each room to find all the keys and learn more about Keykeeper, the mansion, its inhabitants, and yourself. Each room is a piece of the puzzle that comes together at the end of the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game features:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Visual novel with choices </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Multiple endings </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Point &amp; click elements</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Chronoturn","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3391660/bae3072d48358288d759d671096b320ada7b2a7c.jpg"},{"name":"Souuuup!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3391660/44321cc67553a896cab7ef0a7a4e8c058bf5b158.jpg"},{"name":"We don't understand you","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3391660/ddb720084ff3b83120854d7c0c1c52f4f9475bbd.jpg"},{"name":"Decadence","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3391660/472f3a6a7e4c6bcb9e1e4b4aded6308f19652e6d.jpg"},{"name":"Majestic Aconitum","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3391660/ed0cfa1b54f5b298db5b109b68802dd9a3201c38.jpg"},{"name":"You have disappointed Chief","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamco